.TH SCS-ADMINTUI 1 "September 2026" "sslcrtsrv 0.8.4" "SSLCrtSrv Manual"
.SH NAME
scs-admintui \- SSLCrtSrv full-screen terminal admin dashboard
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scs-admintui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B scs-admintui
launches a full-screen terminal dashboard covering onboarding clients,
and managing certificates, clients, permissions, notifiers, and server
configuration, all from one place. It takes no arguments beyond
.B \-h
/
.B \-\-help
and
.BR \-\-version ;
the entire interface is the dashboard itself, reached once the program
starts.
.PP
Once running:
.B q
quits, and
.B F5
refreshes the active tab. Each tab has its own keybindings, shown in the
dashboard's own footer.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/sslcrtsrv/server_config.json
\(em default configuration file; read and, from the dashboard's Config tab,
written.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR scs-crtmanager (1),
.BR scs-cltmanager (1),
.BR scs-server (1)
.PP
The project's
.I Manual.MD
documents every tab of the dashboard in detail.
.SH AUTHOR
Garry Glendown
